        "code": {
          "text": "Reported anxiety and worry"
        },
        "valueString": "Increased worry over the last 3–4 weeks, with more difficulty keeping worry under control. Feels on edge most days. Mainly worries about health, especially dementia progression and cancer, and fears ending up in a home. Also worries about husband's health."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-2",
      "resource": {
