        "id": "observation-2",
        "status": "final",
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "code": {
          "text": "Health checking and reassurance-seeking behaviour"
        },
        "valueString": "Reads dementia, cancer and symptom-checker websites most nights. Ruminates over minor bodily symptoms and fears cancer or rapid dementia worsening. Multiple recent phone contacts and two face-to-face visits in the last month for benign issues. Repeatedly requests reassurance and asks whether tests or scans are needed; remains preoccupied after reassurance."
      }
    },
